      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like the only test we really have for this are the `fontmgr_bounds*` gms, but these source their SkTypefaces from `ToolUtils::TestFontMgr()-\u003ecreateStyleSet` which we don\u0027t have with Fontations yet, so I just hacked the gm locally to create a SkTypeface from some of the fonts in the `resources/fonts` directory.",
      "parentUuid": "11e484ce_5378efbe",
      "revId": "1df0289af4d37b506440f830b7714acadeeb6761",
