    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "31e24bae_ccc8c17d",
        "filename": "src/ports/SkTypeface_fontations.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 694,
      "author": {
        "id": 6155
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-28T08:07:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think if we set these metrics to `0` anyway here, we can do that straight in the ffi instead of using `NaN` as a `std::optional`, wdyt? I don\u0027t think we need to have the ffi API used anywhere else and I don\u0027t consider it public API, and I\u0027ve placed Skia typeface specific logic straight in there. If we\u0027d have another client for ffi that needs to know whether the metric exists or not, we can change that.",
      "revId": "1df0289af4d37b506440f830b7714acadeeb6761",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5710ea47_4975e71d",
        "filename": "src/ports/SkTypeface_fontations.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 694,
      "author": {
        "id": 5140
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-28T14:49:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We still need to know here if the values were present or not (to set the flags). I\u0027m only setting these to 0 here to ensure that they are initialized to something (so `SkFontMetrics::operator\u003d\u003d` can work). We also need to set the flag. Now we could handle this in the ffi, setting the values to 0 if not present and also having explicit boolean flags for if the values were present or not. It\u0027s just that floats already have a NaN and we know that\u0027s not a good value for a position or thickness.\n\nI suppose this could be clearer if this setting to 0 were in an `else`, or maybe in a complicated ternary, like this beauty with a comma operator:\n\n```\nout_metrics-\u003efUnderlinePosition \u003d !sk_float_isnan(metrics.underline_position)\n    ? out_metrics-\u003efFlags |\u003d SkFontMetrics::kUnderlinePositionIsValid_Flag\n    , -metrics.underline_position\n    : 0;\n```",
      "parentUuid": "31e24bae_ccc8c17d",
      "revId": "1df0289af4d37b506440f830b7714acadeeb6761",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
