      "writtenOn": "2024-03-28T08:07:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "See other comment, I\u0027d say let\u0027s be consistent with the other optional metrics and map to 0 here directly. \n\nSince the default value (whether it\u0027s `0` or `NaN`) is constant not expensive to compute (and thus does not require lazy evaluation), it\u0027s a little less verbose to use `.map_or()`\n\n```suggestion\n        underline_position: skrifa_metrics.underline.map_or(0, |u| u.offset),\n```",
